+  DISPLAY EDITOR-1 
+      WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
+  ENABLE B-ok B-cancel EDITOR-1 
+      WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
+  VIEW FRAME Dialog-Frame.
+  {&OPEN-BROWSERS-IN-QUERY-Dialog-Frame}
+END PROCEDURE.
+
+/* _UIB-CODE-BLOCK-END */
+&ANALYZE-RESUME
+
